English:
theorem AwayMap.lift_eq
  given: (hg : IsUnit (g x)) (a : M)
  statement: F.lift x hg (F a) = g a
  proof: Submonoid.LocalizationMap.lift_eq _ _ _

@[simp]

中文:
定理 AwayMap.lift_eq
  条件: (hg : 是单位 (g x)) (a : M)
